:false,"description":"Changes related to the checkbox component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6621343518,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABiqmvHg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/breaking%20change","name":"breaking change","color":"A33CD6","default":false,"description":"Introduces changes that are not backward compatible.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6621343554,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABiqmvQg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20radio%20group","name":"component: radio group","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the radio group component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":15,"created_at":"2025-11-13T08:13:42Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T18:17:24Z","closed_at":"2025-11-17T09:22:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/3205","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-17T09:22:28Z"},"body":"**Breaking:** `Checkbox.Root`, `Radio.Root` and `Switch.Root` renders `<span>` instead of `<button>`\r\n\r\nLabels can't wrap both a `button` and the hidden `input` since it's [invalid HTML](https://validator.w3.org/nu/?doc=https%3A%2F%2Fbase-ui.com%2Freact%2Fcomponents%2Fradio)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"700\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-13 at 4 16 13 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/409f8525-f9a1-4a46-a524-bbd0f38e4448\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nWAVE also reports errors on the `button`:\r\n<img width=\"1000\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-17 at 3 03 02 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/faba9218-5af1-45e9-806c-bd4ab88292bd\" />\r\n\r\n- ~Clicking the label to trigger the radio/checkbox/switch doesn't work if it's a `span`, but this is added back via `Field.Label`~ actually works\r\n- HTML validator flags `aria-required` on `role=\"checkbox|switch\"` as invalid, but VO announces the required state correctly so I think it should be kept for checkbox and switch.\r\n\r\nDemos:\r\n- https://deploy-preview-3205--base-ui.netlify.app/experiments/forms/button-controls\r\n- HTML validator: https://validator.w3.org/nu/?doc=https%3A%2F%2Fdeploy-preview-3205--base-ui.netlify.app%2Freact%2Fcomponents%2Fradio\r\n\r\nAlternative to https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3203\r\n\r\n- [x] I have followed (at least) the [PR section of the contributing guide](https://github.com/mui/base-ui/blob/HEAD/CONTRIBUTING.md#sending-a-pull-request).\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"mj12albert","id":4997971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTc5NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4997971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert","html_url":"https://github.com/mj12albert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205/timeline","perf